g on the heat! Flying? If you just believe, there shall be nothing stopping you from touching the sky!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/1945b80c5b71e4aef3a835dffabd6345.poster.avif?t=1754033301\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/1945b80c5b71e4aef3a835dffabd6345.webm?t=1754033301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/1945b80c5b71e4aef3a835dffabd6345.mp4?t=1754033301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>While you may find those who guide your journey in Dragon Hop, there are also some <strong>creatures</strong> who would like to slow your hasty ascent. They are not here to completely ruin the fun... just to be a bit annoying. Nevertheless, you could find a great deal of satisfaction in sniping them off of platforms with a well aimed fireball! And who knows? Maybe it's treasure they were guarding after all.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactions</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/7f548806258020b00e62cb6de4e4010e.poster.avif?t=1754033301\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/7f548806258020b00e62cb6de4e4010e.webm?t=1754033301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650290/extras/7f548806258020b00e62cb6de4e4010e.mp4?t=1754033301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Having a hard time hopping? See if you can use your environment to your advantage. From riding animals, to activating forgotten constructs - sailing boats to opening portals, so much is possible in the world of Dragon Hop. Never be afraid to <strong>explore</strong> and experiment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Happy Hopping!</strong></h2>",
